# Eaglercraft's screens carry the client's and Mojang's art (cavekit-eaglercraft.md: not redistributed): the runner's
# kept pictures of them stay in the host's cache (~/.cache/jihad-eaglercraft/rounds/), never here. Pictures of this
# project's own test pages are kept as for any other script.
